WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:03.680
Señor, déjeme

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:04.720
break it down to you...

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:06.760
Our competitors...

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:08.400
They are like crazed gardeners,

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:09.520
you know?

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:13.040
Just growing skyscrapers of

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:14.720
glass and concrete.

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:16.040
But...

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:17.440
Aspen Corp is taking another

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:18.280
approach.

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:20.560
We...

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:23.320
We want to build suburban

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:25.160
family style hotels.

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:26.320
Because...

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:29.200
Isn't our main goal to spend

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:32.200
more quality time with our families?

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:33.320
Yeah.

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:35.120
It is.

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:46.320
How much

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:48.080
does it take to buy into this project

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:50.000
as the sole investor?

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:53.240
I can explain you everything

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.360
over lunch.

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:55.520
Because right now

00:00:55.520 --> 00:00:57.040
it's your time with your kids.

00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:58.480
Sorry, sweetheart.

00:00:58.480 --> 00:01:00.560
I'm meeting with the senator at lunch.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.200
How about

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:03.560
a late dinner?

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:06.160
Actually, we have to go back

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:08.000
to Baltimore tomorrow.

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:12.520
Yeah, the hotel association

00:01:12.520 --> 00:01:14.440
is wrapping up the year with the party.

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:18.160
Here's the plan.

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:21.560
After we dine together,

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:23.880
you’ll stay here in the guest room.

00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:26.560
And in the morning, my helicopter

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:27.560
will pick you up and take you

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:28.640
to Baltimore.

00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:30.320
I'll make you coffee.

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:32.320
Perfect plan.

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:33.520
Thank you.
